    "Inspected16 study and16 game headings from actual GLB at224 native and fixed pixel density, plus fixed-crop nearest enlargements for details. The accepted low coupe is recognizably varied by royal/cobalt blue paint and two broad cream center bands on hood, roof and rear deck. No logos or tiny text. Side roundels remain visible as foreshortened cream discs at native game view.",
