    "Inspected8 signed phases per camera, both actual-GLB wireframes and per-wheel neutral/quarter/reverse/reset visuals from opposing visible sides. Each road wheel moves independently while other wheels and fixed body/spoiler stay fixed; reset pixels match exactly.",
